t is a test of your defensive tactics and resilience. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/50e0f5e29482afb2669cd31040a75a4c.webp?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.poster.avif?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.webm?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/8b4dcb33ba301c666fffec40e495f2f2.mp4?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sail beyond your borders into a vast world of discovery. Chart unknown territories, encounter pirates, and unveil secret islands. Establish trade routes with new countries, enriching your base with rare resources and exotic rewards. Go beyond the surface and delve deep underground to unearth precious ores, mysterious caves, and secrets that lie beneath your town. What you find may just give you the edge you need to turn the tide against the Yokai. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/d1a3cd0f521c6ce1fbb4e9ae5c470649.webp?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/3842dcde5fd11ad2d39475fba4400d55.poster.avif?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/3842dcde5fd11ad2d39475fba4400d55.webm?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/3842dcde5fd11ad2d39475fba4400d55.mp4?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a world alive with dynamic weather and changing seasons, each bringing its own set of challenges and beauty. Brace your town against natural disasters that test your management skills. How will you adapt to the whims of nature? </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/1133c4d0f4c173e927fce2b87c82d063.avif?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/22600a59834a0c52b086eefea6a55456.poster.avif?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/22600a59834a0c52b086eefea6a55456.webm?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/22600a59834a0c52b086eefea6a55456.mp4?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your run by selecting a path that grants unique bonuses and gameplay style. Enhance your town further with powerful relics that introduce new mechanics. Tweak world and difficulty settings to tailor every playthrough to your preferences. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/20d9ee8231f5ddf8ad9921f4cb4bbc7f.webp?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=62 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/29cb1b0e33a2227aa88477da25bd50d1.poster.avif?t=1770075558\" width=614 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/29cb1b0e33a2227aa88477da25bd50d1.webm?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/extras/29cb1b0e33a2227aa88477da25bd50d1.mp4?t=1770075558\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create not just a functional town, but also a breathtaking one in a rich pixel-art style. Utilize a wide array of decorations to add beauty and charm to your town. From bonsai to ornate statues, each addition makes your town more distinct and visually stunning. </p>","developers":["Ufuk Yurtman"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1303940/7ac0076e45fde7e5d93afc6c49569aab8309da95/header.jpg?t=1770075558","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA(To be announced)</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> TBA(To be announced)</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1303940/346054000/3efbf08f6cda168ae16becd02bced8c562597617/1756741236/dash_av1.mpd?t=17567453